@baseUrl        = http://localhost:3000
@applicantToken = PASTE_TOKEN_APPLICANT_DISINI


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  DASHBOARD
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Applicant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  PROFIL PELAMAR
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Profil Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### Update Profil (JSON)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "gender": "laki-laki",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-05-15",
  "bio": "Fresh graduate S1 Informatika dengan passion di backend development",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "education": "S1 Teknik Informatika - Universitas Indonesia",
  "educationLevel": "S1",
  "experienceYears": 1,
  "skills": ["nodejs", "mysql", "express", "javascript", "git"],
  "linkedinUrl": "https://linkedin.com/in/budisantoso",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/budisantoso"
}

### Upload CV (multipart/form-data)
### Field: cv  |  Tipe: file  |  Format: PDF/DOC/DOCX  |  Max: 5MB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/me/cv
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cv"; filename="cv_budi.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./cv_budi.pdf
------FormBoundary--

### Upload Foto Profil (multipart/form-data)
### Field: photo  |  Tipe: file  |  Format: JPG/PNG/WEBP  |  Max: 2MB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto_budi.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto_budi.jpg
------FormBoundary--


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LOWONGAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lowongan (publik, tanpa token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Filter Lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?keyword=developer&location=Jakarta&job_type=full-time&category_id=1

### Detail Lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1

### Lihat Kategori (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  MATCHING JOB
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lowongan yang Cocok untuk Saya
### (harus isi profil dulu agar matching bekerja)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matching/user
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LAMARAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Melamar Kerja (dengan cover letter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_id": 1,
  "cover_letter": "Perkenalkan, saya Budi Santoso, lulusan S1 Informatika UI. Saya sangat tertarik dengan posisi Backend Developer di perusahaan Anda karena saya memiliki pengalaman di Node.js dan MySQL. Saya yakin dapat berkontribusi secara maksimal untuk tim Anda."
}

### Lihat Semua Lamaran Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### Detail Lamaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### Hapus Lamaran (batalkan)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  INTERVIEW
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Jadwal Interview Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/my
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
